</head>
<body>

    <div class="header">
        <h1 class="title">Global Economy in the Shadow of War:<br>IMF World Economic Outlook Trends 2024–2026</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">A synthesis of IMF World Economic Outlook projections tracking the trajectory of global growth, inflation, and evolving policy priorities amid rising geopolitical uncertainty.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-grid">

        <!-- GROWTH TRAJECTORY -->
        <div class="card full-width">
            <h2 class="card-title">Global Growth Projections: A Narrow Band of Mediocrity</h2>
            <p class="text-body">Global growth has remained stuck in a fragile 3.0–3.3% band across the past eight WEO editions—markedly below the pre-pandemic historical average of roughly 3.8%. The global economy is not collapsing, but structural headwinds and external shocks are preventing a robust recovery.</p>

            <div class="chart-container">
                <div class="legend">
                    <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-color" style="background: #002244;"></div> WEO Growth Projections</div>
